Setup guide

1. Create github codespace from this repo
2. Run `./cbt.sh` (cmake, build, test)

Features
- Build system on modern CMake with dependencies declared on Catch2 and s4_core using FetchContent functionality
- Compile time type information
    - Using constexpr tuple of attributes describing the type (see `src/ctti/type.hpp`)
- Runtime type information
    - 

 
- info
    - size
    - name
    - values
- converters
    - as_fundamental
    - as_enum
    - as_class
- destruction
    - can_delete_object
    - can_destruct
    - destruct
- construction
    - default
        - is_default_constructible
        - can_construct
        - construct
        - new_default
    - move
        - is_move_constructible
        - can_move_construct
        - new_move
        - move_construct
    - copy
        - new_copy
        - can_copy_construct
        - copy_construct
- assignment
    - move
        - is_move_assignable
        - move_assign
    - copy
        - is_copy_assignable
        - copy_assign
- equals type instantiated in different dll
